"biq4s8m0xl": "Beside the report's enlarged photo of the cut surface, marks made by sawing cow bone with sample saws are mounted side by side. The samples: the task force's seized saw, the Mokgol Sawmill band saw, and store-bought saws.",
"1swctfg2mgj": "Femur cut surface (enlarged)",
