"1lwxuj1w6zi": "Between the chisels and the planes, a new [[double-edged saw|k_saw]]. The rattan wrap on the handle is still white and the price tag is still on — “[[Daeseong Hardware|k_hardware]] 3,800.” Just below it is another saw-shaped patch with less dust on it.",
