"17y6gjttaq4": "Observer's comment: in the November dry season the Sangpo weir gates are shut and the water all but stands still. Floating objects drift at around 150 m an hour. The tide does not reach below the weir, so the water never flows back upstream.",
"1ej4ryqh3ea": "Trace the sacks' drift back upstream. Count it off 150 meters and one hour at a time.",
