"1pe6n6re1bs": "Statement of the tent bar owner: “That customer came in around 8 in the evening and drank three bottles of soju by himself. When the man next to him started ribbing him about the market, he grabbed him by the collar.”",
"9gg4eqcezf": "※ No record of the Euncheon Station task force ever requesting this log. (Substation chief's memo, 1987. 3)",
"oudygx6fq4": "Witness Statement — Bus Conductor",
"fv0x618j56": "Euncheon Station 86-VC-411 · 25",
"krb2y0pa2z": "November 26, 1986 · Euncheon Transit depot · witness Yang Mi-suk (21) · conductor, Route 11",
"8uedlhno35": "No. 11 bus at Mokgol Terminus. A single streetlight.",
"1dd78yuvnju": "Q: Have you seen the man in this photo?",
"22ikrflkgi6": "A: Yes. He got on at the stop in front of Central Market around 8:20 on Friday night, the 14th. He had a blue vinyl bag tucked under his arm. He paid with one [[bus token|k_token]].",
"1xvpa4wttvj": "A: We got to [[Mokgol Terminus|k_terminal]] around 8:45 and he was the last passenger. He got off and walked into the alley beside the [[Soyang Inn|k_inn]], across from the terminus.",
"17y0qg3ivdo": "Q: What is in that alley?",
"19uwqdqzf8x": "A: I don't really know. I saw signs for a rice shop and a hardware store. Further in it's pitch dark.",
"24c2rksnh5t": "Q: How do you remember him?",
"12vfxn04bfc": "A: When we were turning the bus around at the terminus, that bag flashed blue under the streetlight. And hardly anyone rides out to Mokgol at that hour.",
